── SYNTAX ERROR ─────────────────────────────────── E0100_import.lt:1:1  [E0100]

Stilt imports a module with `use`, not `import`:

  1 │ import std.fs
    │ ^^^^^^

`use std.fs` imports a module, whose items are then named through it, as
`fs.exists`.

To fix it, write `use`:

  1 │ use std.fs
    │ ~~~
